ng went to [ __ ] before we even  started the game she's lived in yara her  whole life and she was just in the wrong  place since birth it's a very different  way to introduce a character that we  haven't seen done yet and it's also the  first time we have a character who's  native and familiar with the land we're  in the only person that could also  belong in that description is the deputy  is seeing as he was stationed at hope  county but it doesn't really help much  since he doesn't talk danny and the  other people she meets with all talk  about their times in yara all the things  they did when they were young and they  talk about all the locations in the game  like they're familiar with them because  they are another change was danny's  motivation when i play story games i try  to break them as much as i can in the  context of backstory i've done this  quite a bit when creating characters in  d and d so i created a character that  wants to go adventuring the biggest  question is why to relate this to far  cry 6 why deviate from your original  gold to do something else for danny the  moment she gets on the beach she says  that she wants to go to miami and leave  the island so my first thought is how  are they going to convince us that dandy  changed her ideals and now attempts to  start a revolution honestly it's not  clear and specific for the sake of  gameplay but what i have come up with is  that because dany has a background in  weapons as she was once a soldier she  decided to help clara in the beginning  as they have a mutual agreement if dany  does this job for her clara gets her a  boat and dany helps her take back one of  the islands and once she's helped her  and realize that she is skilled enough  to take on a small island mostly by  herself it might be enough to convince  her that she is capable of winning this  revolution whether or not you believe  that is up to you but more importantly  the game never took away her original  plan after taking back 